<title>HONG KONG: HK's Pacific Link Communications seeks financing.</title>
<headline>HK's Pacific Link Communications seeks financing.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Standard Chartered Bank will lead a US$25.5 million equipment financing facility for Pacific Link Communications Ltd, a syndicate manager said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The facility will carry a maturity of seven to eight years. It will be partially guaranteed by Lucent Technologies Inc.</p>
<p>Pacific Link Communications, a 65 percent subsidiary of First Pacific Company Ltd, is a cellular telephone network operator.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6960</p>
